///1WELCOME
Help by Willem Aandewiel
WELCOME - About the WELCOME.TXT text file

///2READING
WELCOME.TXT is a text file, not an executable CP/M command.
Read it from the CP/M prompt with:

  A>TYPE WELCOME.TXT
  E>TYPE A:WELCOME.TXT

TYPE is built into CP/M; no TYPE.COM is required.

///2CONTENTS
Your WELCOME.TXT has not been supplied.
This page therefore makes no claims about the installation details
it contains. Read the original file for the actual information.
